  "result": "`default_map` entries now reach subcommands. The full suite passes (1908 passed, 102 skipped, 1 xfailed).\n\n- **Fix:** In `src/click/core.py`, a child context now takes `parent.default_map.get(info_name)` instead of inheriting the parent's whole map. A subcommand with no entry gets no defaults.\n- **Tests:** I added two tests to `tests/test_defaults.py`. One covers subcommand defaults, a CLI argument overriding them, and an unrelated subcommand being unaffected. The other covers a nested group.\n- **Changelog:** I added the fix under a new `Version 8.5.1 / Unreleased` heading in `CHANGES.md`, since 8.5.0 is already marked released. Adjust the version number if you plan something different.\n\nI haven't committed anything.",
